BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (says to expect $8,000 or more. About $10,000 is the most they have seen anyone pay, and that was for terrible credit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm ([BKciSMvLpD8 @ 00:02:23]. Surety Bonds Direct converts this into rates. They routinely see rates from just above) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (1% to 5%. A 1.3% rate equals a $975 premium, which they call currently the best rate on the market, while poor or) Tj ET
