BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 477.77 Tm (The most expensive failures Seaton walked through started with nobody checking who actually backed into the dock.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 462.55 Tm (In one case, two reputable broker-carriers tendered loads to a fraudster posing as a broker, the bills of lading at pickup) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 447.32 Tm (never showed the actual carrier's name, and roughly three weeks later the parties realized the loads were copper wire in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 432.10 Tm (a scam of over $2.6 million; all seven loads had been reconsigned to an empty warehouse, and six months on nobody,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 416.87 Tm (including the FBI, FMCSA, and state police, could find the freight [jnoJihiGSEA @ 00:22:34]. In another, over two) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 401.65 Tm (dozen victims were scammed by an outfit FMCSA showed running only 60,000 miles, freight was claimed broken) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 386.42 Tm (down at a Montana truck stop, seals came back broken and resealed, and the home office was a McMansion in Ohio) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 371.20 Tm ([jnoJihiGSEA @ 00:32:16]. Bridge Logistics describes the same endgame: the real carrier is sent to an unknown) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 355.97 Tm (location and the product is transloaded onto another victimized carrier with a new bill of lading [uT4ymtB7YcA @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 340.75 Tm (00:02:31]. Cana's tell is silence. When dispatch goes dark after booking or tracking fails, the cargo is gone, and getting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 325.52 Tm (law enforcement to take cargo theft seriously remains the problem [3dI5z6SHDPc @ 00:18:48].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 310.30 Tm (The economics of a single double-brokered load hit everyone twice. Nate Cross warns that when the fraudster collects) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 295.07 Tm (and never pays the hauling carrier, the broker typically ends up paying for the same load twice, once to the fraudster) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 279.85 Tm (and again to the carrier that actually moved it [gnxgKnnz6Jw @ 00:01:27]. Bridge Logistics adds that defrauded) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 264.62 Tm (carriers go after shippers for payment when they cannot track down the fake broker, that legitimate brokers are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 249.40 Tm (commonly on the hook for multiple payments, and that the rates promised to double-brokered carriers run much higher) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 234.17 Tm (than what the legitimate broker negotiated [uT4ymtB7YcA @ 00:01:09]. Seaton describes collection agencies that find) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 218.95 Tm (a hoodwinked small carrier, take an assignment for 50 percent of whatever they collect, and hammer upstream, so the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 203.72 Tm (honest broker catches heat from the customer over a $3,000 demand on a load the broker never knew was double) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 188.50 Tm (brokered [jnoJihiGSEA @ 00:15:35]. George of Truck Driver Nation frames the carrier's side: that money is fuel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 173.27 Tm (money, the only path back in most scenarios is to back source the load all the way to the original direct shipper and bill) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 158.05 Tm (them, and speed matters because the fraudster is racing to collect first [5dP6IV7sJW0 @ 00:02:47].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 142.82 Tm (Identity hijacks are the trap that compounds fastest. Cana warns that DOT PIN numbers compromised in the March) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 127.60 Tm (2023 data breach are for sale on the dark web, and that the minute a carrier discovers its information was pirated, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 112.37 Tm (problem has existed for at least 24 hours with at least 100 loads double brokered in its name [3dI5z6SHDPc @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 97.15 Tm (00:17:23]. Scammers also post a fake load, award it to a real carrier, harvest the setup documents, and sit on them for as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 81.92 Tm (long as the insurance stays good, up to three months, before booking freight under that identity, while brokers get) Tj ET
